- Vmag is within range of [4, 8]

These conditions capture the main patterns seen in the examples and align with astrophysical understanding: giants have spectral types with luminosity class III or III/IV, are intrinsically brighter (lower Amag), often have redder colors (higher B-V), and tend to have smaller parallax (farther away) but not always.